// Gore-sump drum — an oversized magazine: adds capacity (more rounds before a reload) at the
// cost of a SLOWER reload (the bulk takes longer to swap). GTW-549 data-driven attachment ITEM
// (the grimdark "GoreSumpDrum" tag). Magnitudes live HERE on the item; applied post-spawn.
// The slow reload is authored as a ReloadTime > 1.0 (the reload-cost scale is a BIDIRECTIONAL
// multiplier, so > 1.0 makes the swap slower — the drum's bulk; < 1.0 would speed it).
(
    display_name: "Gore-Sump Drum",
    // GTW-584: re-slotted Rail -> Magazine. An oversized ammo drum is a magazine, so it
    // belongs in the magazine well now that one exists (GTW-554 hung it off the Rail only
    // because there was no Magazine slot yet). Fits only a gun declaring a Magazine slot.
    slot: Magazine,
    effects: [
        ExtraAmmo(15),      // +15 magazine capacity — tunable
        ReloadTime(1.5),    // ×1.5 the reload_tu (> 1 = slower swap, the drum's bulk) — tunable
    ],
)
